invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_message.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: the hello offers the raw public key alone to a configuration that has
  anchors too, so a server with a certificate chain and no raw key
  cannot answer it. The pins-with-anchors offer row objects.

--- old
    if (x509) {
        wb_u8(w, CH_CERT_TYPE_X509);
    }
--- new
    (void)x509;
